%% Lesson 03 — Action, outcome, explain (dual edges)
flowchart TB
  AG["Agent<br/>performs"]
  SG["SubGoal 0<br/>Write core memory API<br/><b>completed</b>"]
  ACT["Action + prov:Activity<br/>Implemented create_plan / progress<br/><i>rationale…</i>"]
  OUT["Outcome<br/>Unit tests green<br/><b>success: true</b>"]
  SG -->|achievedBy| ACT
  ACT -->|achieves| SG
  ACT -->|performedBy| AG
  AG -->|performs| ACT
  ACT -->|hasOutcome| OUT
  OUT -->|outcomeOf| ACT
